  },
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What this dashboard is for",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Purpose**\n\nSee advancing or idle polling batches and completed cycles.\n\n**Audience**\n\nOperators of Catalog projections, media reconciliation, Branding logo reclamation, and Admin retention.\n\n**Decision supported**\n\nIdentify the worker whose current batch needs investigation, even during its first cycle.\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Advancing batch age",
      "description": "Elapsed seconds of the longest advancing batch per worker. Idle workers report zero. A fixed cached reading drops out as its earlier increases leave the three-minute window.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "verify": "idle-ok",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "Prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (sharedkernel_scheduling_service_name) ((sharedkernel_scheduling_polling_batch_active_duration_seconds{sharedkernel_scheduling_service_name=~\"catalog-projections|catalog-media-object-reconciliation|branding-logo-reclamation|admin-document-(draft|audit|idempotency)-retention\"} and (delta(sharedkernel_scheduling_polling_batch_active_duration_seconds[3m]) > 0)) or (sharedkernel_scheduling_polling_batch_active_duration_seconds{sharedkernel_scheduling_service_name=~\"catalog-projections|catalog-media-object-reconciliation|branding-logo-reclamation|admin-document-(draft|audit|idempotency)-retention\"} == 0))",
          "legendFormat": "{{sharedkernel_scheduling_service_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Completed cycles in 30 hours",
      "description": "Observed increases in completed cycle counts by worker and outcome. The window includes the daily Admin retention cadence.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "Prometheus"
      },
      "verify": "idle-ok",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "Prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (sharedkernel_scheduling_service_name, sharedkernel_scheduling_outcome) (increase(sharedkernel_scheduling_polling_cycle_duration_seconds_count{sharedkernel_scheduling_service_name=~\"catalog-projections|catalog-media-object-reconciliation|branding-logo-reclamation|admin-document-(draft|audit|idempotency)-retention\"}[30h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{sharedkernel_scheduling_service_name}} / {{sharedkernel_scheduling_outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
